      "uz_compare": "O'zbekchada rasmiy suhbatda 'Tushundim' o'rniga 'Tushundim, janob' yoki 'Ishlaganman' o'rniga 'Ishlaganman' deymiz — farq ohangda. Koreyschada rasmiylik qo'shimchada: 일했어요 → 일했습니다.",
      "compare_en": "In English, formality is in word choice ('I would like to…'). In Korean it's in the ending: 일했어요 (polite) → 일했습니다 (formal)."
