      "uz_compare": "O'zbekchadagi '-gan' sifatdoshi bilan aynan bir xil: 'men ishlaGAN kompaniya' = 제가 일한 회사. Tartib ham bir xil!",
      "compare_en": "Like English 'the company (that) I worked at' — but in Korean the description comes BEFORE the noun: 제가 일한 회사 ('I worked-at company')."
